# Compose builds use the repo root as context (`context: ..`), so this
# file matters a lot: without it, COPY backend/ . and COPY frontend/ .
# would bake the host's .venv / node_modules (platform-mismatched
# binaries) straight into the image, and bloat every build's context
# upload besides.
.git/
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
backend/staticfiles/
backend/.pytest_cache/
backend/ml/artifacts/
frontend/dist/
docs/
*.md
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
